essential_indicators.text:
Provide details of any corrective action taken or underway to address safety-related incidents (if
    any) and on significant risks / concerns arising from assessments of health & safety practices and
   working conditions.
     Corrective actions taken to address safety-related incidents include:

     1)  Conducting thorough investigation for identifying the root cause of the incident;

     2)  Implementing immediate measures to mitigate any risks or hazards;

     3)  Developing and implementing long-term corrective actions to prevent recurring of similar incidents;

     4)  Reviewing and updating safety procedures, protocols, and training to enhance prevention and response
        measures.
